| `modules/note/src/Entity/ProbePage.php` | create | A Page in Entity |
| `modules/note/src/Service/ProbeRaw.php` | create | An ungranted RawHtml |
| `modules/note/src/Controller/ProbeLiteralPage.php` | create | Markup in a controller |

### Locked-In Decisions

1. Only the label's text changes.

